        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169522277?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This change corrects the language comparison by clarifying that increment chaining is possible in C++ only for pre-increment expressions. It avoids the incorrect implication that such chaining is generally supported in C, and improves the technical precision of the explanation around value vs reference evaluation.<br>
